// Core Routing
User Request > Load Balancer
Load Balancer > System Servers: Distribute Requests

System Servers > Storage: Store and Retrieve Big files and images
System Servers > Data Layer: Access and Manage Data
System Servers > Queue Management: Handle Background Tasks

Redis Cache <> MySQL

Messaging & Notifications > System Servers: Trigger Notifications
Queue Management > Messaging & Notifications: Process Messages
